":{"line":46,"column":57,"offset":1627},"end":{"line":46,"column":78,"offset":1648}}},{"type":"text","value":"。","position":{"start":{"line":46,"column":78,"offset":1648},"end":{"line":46,"column":79,"offset":1649}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":46,"column":1,"offset":1571},"end":{"line":46,"column":79,"offset":1649}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pinocchio 程序","position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":3,"offset":1655},"end":{"line":48,"column":15,"offset":1667}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1,"offset":1653},"end":{"line":48,"column":17,"offset":1669}}},{"type":"text","value":"：通过 Solana CLI 部署，并将您的配置设置为 localnet：","position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":17,"offset":1669},"end":{"line":48,"column":54,"offset":1706}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"solana program deploy ./target/deploy/your_program.so --program-id ./target/deploy/your_program-keypair.json","position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":54,"offset":1706},"end":{"line":48,"column":164,"offset":1816}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1,"offset":1653},"end":{"line":48,"column":164,"offset":1816}}},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"在 Anchor Workspace 中运行 ","position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":3,"offset":1822},"end":{"line":50,"column":26,"offset":1845}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"surfpool start","position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":26,"offset":1845},"end":{"line":50,"column":42,"offset":1861}}},{"type":"text","value":"，可提示您使用基础设施即代码（Infrastructure as Code），以便在 Surfnet 上无缝自动部署您的程序。","position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":42,"offset":1861},"end":{"line":50,"column":105,"offset":1924}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":3,"offset":1822},"end":{"line":50,"column":105,"offset":1924}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":1,"offset":1820},"end":{"line":50,"column":105,"offset":1924}}},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"测试程序","position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":5,"offset":1932},"end":{"line":52,"column":9,"offset":1936}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":1,"offset":1928},"end":{"line":52,"column":9,"offset":1936}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"部署到 localnet 后，通过定位本地验证器连接到 Surfnet：","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":1,"offset":1940},"end":{"line":54,"column":37,"offset":1976}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":1,"offset":1940},"end":{"line":54,"column":37,"offset":1976}}},{"type":"code","lang":"ts","meta":null,"value":"import { Connection } from \"@solana/web3.js\";\r\n\r\nconst connection = new Connection(\"http://localhost:8899\", \"confirmed\");","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":1,"offset":1980},"end":{"line":60,"column":4,"offset":2113}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-0"}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":60,"column":4,"offset":2113}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# Surfpool 101\r\n\r\n![使用 Surfpool 进行测试](/graphics/course-banners/testing-with-surfpool.png)\r\n\r\n测试依赖跨程序调用（CPI）的 Solana 程序，传统上需要开发者从主网导出账户和程序，然后将其上传到本地验证器。\r\n\r\n这种方法适用于少量账户，但在测试像 Jupiter 这样复杂的程序时完全不可行，因为它可能依赖于 40 多个账户和 8 个以上的程序。\r\n\r\nSurfpool 通过以下功能解决了这个问题，使开发者能够使用按需获取的主网账户在本地模拟程序：\r\n- **自定义系统变量**：时间旅行（在任何历史 slot 或时间戳测试您的程序）、暂停时钟或停止区块生产\r\n- **修改账户数据**：设置 SOL 供应量（总量、流通量和非流通量）、在程序之间传输账户数据，或更新账户核心数据和代币账户信息\r\n- **分析链上数据**：分析交易的计算单元、账户变更和执行详情，然后通过签名、UUID 或标签检索详细的分析报告\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"什么是 Surfpool\" id=\"what-is-surfpool\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n[Surfpool](https://docs.surfpool.run/) 是一个全面的 SDK 和工具套件，而 **Surfnet** 是它创建的本地 Solana 网络。可以将 Surfpool 视为您的开发环境，而 Surfnet 则是运行在其中的区块链网络。\r\n\r\nSurfnet 是 solana-test-validator 的直接替代品，专为 Solana 开发者提供最佳开发体验而设计。\r\n\r\n由 [TxTx](https://x.com/txtx_sol) 团队开发，Surfpool 无缝将基础设施即代码（Infrastructure as Code）集成到基于 Anchor 的项目中，从而实现可复现、可审计且安全的部署，无论是到私有还是公共的 Solana 网络。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"第一步\" id=\"first-steps\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n运行 Surfnet 所需的一切都包含在 Surfpool SDK 中。由于安装因操作系统而异，请根据您的具体设置，参阅官方的[安装页面](https://docs.surfpool.run/install)。\r\n\r\n安装 Surfpool SDK 后，使用以下命令启动 Surfnet：\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nsurfpool start\r\n```\r\n\r\n这将在标准本地验证器端口（`http://127.0.0.1:8899`）上启动 Surfnet，并显示一个终端用户界面，其中包括：\r\n- **槽位和纪元**：当前执行的槽位每 400 毫秒自动处理一次。使用 **Tab** 手动前进到下一个槽位，或使用 **空格键** 暂停/恢复自动区块生产。\r\n- **交易日志**：带有时间戳的活动流，显示所有执行的交易。\r\n\r\n如果需要基于浏览器的体验，请通过[此链接](http://127.0.0.1:8899)连接到 Surfpool Studio。\r\n\r\n> Surfpool Studio 包含所有终端用户界面功能，并提供额外的功能，例如时间旅行和为任何铸币账户添加代币。\r\n\r\n### 部署程序\r\n\r\n设置 Surfnet 后，部署您的程序并开始构建。\r\n\r\n**Anchor 程序**：使用 `anchor deploy`，并将您的 `Anchor.toml` 配置为 `[programs.localnet]`。\r\n\r\n**Pinocchio 程序**：通过 Solana CLI 部署，并将您的配置设置为 localnet：`solana program deploy ./target/deploy/your_program.so --program-id ./target/deploy/your_program-keypair.json`\r\n\r\n> 在 Anchor Workspace 中运行 `surfpool start`，可提示您使用基础设施即代码（Infrastructure as Code），以便在 Surfnet 上无缝自动部署您的程序。\r\n\r\n### 测试程序\r\n\r\n部署到 localnet 后，通过定位本地验证器连接到 Surfnet：\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nimport { Connection } from \"@solana/web3.js\";\r\n\r\nconst connection = new Connection(\"http://localhost:8899\", \"confirmed\");\r\n```","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"ts","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"import"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" { Connection } "}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"from"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#DEE492"},"children":[{"type":"tex